s://leetcode.com/problems/fix-names-in-a-table/", "name": "Fix Names in a Table", "title": "Fix Names in a Table", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_2", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Fix Names in a Table\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/fix-names-in-a-table/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-3", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/calculate-special-bonus/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/calculate-special-bonus/", "name": "Calculate Special Bonus", "title": "Calculate Special Bonus", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_3", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Calculate Special Bonus\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/calculate-special-bonus/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-4", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/rearrange-products-table/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/rearrange-products-table/", "name": "Rearrange Products Table", "title": "Rearrange Products Table", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_4", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Rearrange Products Table\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/rearrange-products-table/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-5", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/the-latest-login-in-2020/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/the-latest-login-in-2020/", "name": "The Latest Login in 2020", "title": "The Latest Login in 2020", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_5", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"The Latest Login in 2020\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/the-latest-login-in-2020/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-6", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/employees-with-missing-information/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/employees-with-missing-information/", "name": "Employees With Missing Information", "title": "Employees With Missing Information", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_6", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Employees With Missing Information\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/employees-with-missing-information/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-7", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/bank-account-summary-ii/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/bank-account-summary-ii/", "name": "Bank Account Summary II", "title": "Bank Account Summary II", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_7", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Bank Account Summary II\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/bank-account-summary-ii/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-8", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/capital-gainloss/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/capital-gainloss/", "name": "Capital Gain/Loss", "title": "Capital Gain/Loss", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_8", "difficulty": "Medium", "description": "Solve \\"Capital Gain/Loss\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/capital-gainloss/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-9", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/recyclable-and-low-fat-products/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/recyclable-and-low-fat-products/", "name": "Recyclable and Low Fat Products", "title": "Recyclable and Low Fat Products", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_9", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Recyclable and Low Fat Products\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/recyclable-and-low-fat-products/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-10", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/find-customer-referee/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/find-customer-referee/", "name": "Find Customer Referee", "title": "Find Customer Referee", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_10", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Find Customer Referee\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/find-customer-referee/"}]	\N	### 📌 Topic Overview\nThe `UPDATE` statement modifies existing records in a table. Because an unguarded `UPDATE` will permanently overwrite **every single row** in your table, production database engineering requires strict defensive patterns.\n\n### 🛠️ Core `UPDATE` Patterns\n\n#### 1. Single-Column Update (With the "Select-First" Safety Rule)\nAlways run a `SELECT` query with your exact `WHERE` clause first to inspect the target rows before mutating them:\n```sql\n-- Step 1: Verify target row first\nSELECT * FROM users WHERE email = 'priya.singh@college.com';\n\n-- Step 2: Execute the update targeting a UNIQUE column or PRIMARY KEY\nUPDATE users\nSET is_active = true\nWHERE email = 'priya.singh@college.com';\n```\n\n#### 2. Multi-Column Update with `RETURNING`\nUpdate multiple columns separated by commas and use `RETURNING` to confirm the updated state in one step:\n```sql\nUPDATE users\nSET \n    email = 'sunita.sharma@admin.com',\n    role = 'admin'\nWHERE name = 'Prof. Sunita Sharma'\nRETURNING id, name, email, role;\n```\n\n#### 3. Dynamic Calculation Updates\nIncrease fees by 10% for all courses currently priced at or below 3000:\n```sql\nUPDATE courses\nSET fee = fee * 1.10\nWHERE fee <= 3000\nRETURNING id, title, fee;\n```\n\n### ⚠️ Production Safety Checklist\n1. **Never Omit the `WHERE` Clause:** Running `UPDATE users SET is_active = true;` without a `WHERE` clause overwrites every row in the table.\n2. **Target Primary Keys or Unique Columns:** Filtering by `WHERE name = 'Sachin'` can unintentionally update dozens of users who share the same name. Always filter by `id` or `email`.\n3. **Clearing Data:** Use `SET metadata = NULL` (not an empty string `''`) when clearing optional fields.	Thapa Technical (Vinod Bahadur Thapa)	https://www.youtube.com/@ThapaTechnical	654	Lecture 6: Modifying Data with UPDATE — Single/Multi-Column SET, Dynamic Math & WHERE Safety	Update single and multiple fields, compute in-place numeric updates, verify changes immediately with RETURNING, and prevent full-table overwrites.	23	Easy	Module 2: CRUD Operations & Data Manipulation	6	[{"id": "pg-6-prob-1", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/swap-salary/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/swap-salary/", "name": "Swap Salary (UPDATE Statement Mastery)", "title": "Swap Salary (UPDATE Statement Mastery)", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_1", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Swap Salary (UPDATE Statement Mastery)\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/swap-salary/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-2", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/fix-names-in-a-table/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/fix-names-in-a-table/", "name": "Fix Names in a Table", "title": "Fix Names in a Table", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_2", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Fix Names in a Table\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/fix-names-in-a-table/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-3", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/calculate-special-bonus/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/calculate-special-bonus/", "name": "Calculate Special Bonus", "title": "Calculate Special Bonus", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_3", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Calculate Special Bonus\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/calculate-special-bonus/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-4", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/rearrange-products-table/", "link": "https://leetcode.com/problems/rearrange-products-table/", "name": "Rearrange Products Table", "title": "Rearrange Products Table", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "6_4", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Solve \\"Rearrange Products Table\\" on LeetCode using PostgreSQL.", "external_url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/rearrange-products-table/"}, {"id": "pg-6-prob-5", "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/the-latest-login-in-2020/", "link