match** users that have **tags**, **$unwind** tags, **$group** by tags and count. Sort by count descending.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b67a3fe74e0db3727c"}, {"id": "mongo-9-prob-7", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b67a3fe74e0db37279", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b67a3fe74e0db37279", "name": "Problem #430: Find users with age not in 25 30 35", "title": "Problem #430: Find users with age not in 25 30 35", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "430", "difficulty": "Medium", "description": "Return users where **age** is not 25, 30, or 35. Use **$nin**.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b67a3fe74e0db37279"}, {"id": "mongo-9-prob-8", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b47a3fe74e0db371fe", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b47a3fe74e0db371fe", "name": "Problem #461: Nor: not admin and not editor", "title": "Problem #461: Nor: not admin and not editor", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "461", "difficulty": "Hard", "description": "Return users where **role** is neither \\"admin\\" nor \\"editor\\". Use **$nor**.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b47a3fe74e0db371fe"}, {"id": "mongo-9-prob-9", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b47a3fe74e0db371f2", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b47a3fe74e0db371f2", "name": "Problem #465: Users with role not admin", "title": "Problem #465: Users with role not admin", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "465", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Return users where **role** is not \\"admin\\".", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b47a3fe74e0db371f2"}, {"id": "mongo-9-prob-10", "url": "https://mongopractice.online