db.students.deleteMany({ class: "BCA" })\n// Returns: { acknowledged: true, deletedCount: 2 }\n\n// 4. Delete all documents in the collection (empty filter object {} is mandatory)\ndb.students.deleteMany({})\n```\n\n### ⚠️ Common Mistakes\n* **Calling `deleteMany()` Without `{}`:** Calling `db.students.deleteMany()` with empty parentheses throws a missing filter error; you must explicitly pass `{}` (`db.students.deleteMany({})`) to confirm deleting all documents.	Yahoo Baba	https://www.youtube.com/@YahooBaba	655	Lecture 9: Deleting Documents — deleteOne(), deleteMany() & Collection Truncation	Remove single matching documents by _id or filter using deleteOne(), bulk-delete matching records with deleteMany(), and empty entire collections safely using deleteMany({}).	20	Easy	\N	9	[{"id": "mongo-9-prob-1", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db37627", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db37627", "name": "Problem #120: Logs with level not debug", "title": "Problem #120: Logs with level not debug", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "120", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Return logs where **level** is not \\"debug\\".", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db37627"}, {"id": "mongo-9-prob-2", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bb7a3fe74e0db374c0", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bb7a3fe74e0db374c0", "name": "Problem #239: Products with all ratings >= 3", "title": "Problem #239: Products with all ratings >= 3", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "239", "difficulty": "Hard", "description": "Return products where no element in **ratings** is less than 3. Use **$not** and **$lt**.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bb7a3fe74e0db374c0"}, {"id": "mongo-9-prob-3", "url": "https://mongopractice.online