ers with type of age number", "title": "Problem #474: Find users with type of age number", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "474", "difficulty": "Hard", "description": "Return users where **age** is of type number (double). Use **$type** and type number 1 or \\"double\\".", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b47a3fe74e0db371d7"}, {"id": "mongo-13-prob-7", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b37a3fe74e0db37186", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b37a3fe74e0db37186", "name": "Problem #501: Find users without managerId", "title": "Problem #501: Find users without managerId", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "501", "difficulty": "Medium", "description": "Return users that do not have a **managerId** field. Use **$exists**.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b37a3fe74e0db37186"}, {"id": "mongo-13-prob-8", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b37a3fe74e0db37183", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b37a3fe74e0db37183", "name": "Problem #502: Find users with salary field present", "title": "Problem #502: Find users with salary field present", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "502", "difficulty": "Medium", "description": "Return users that have a **salary** field. Use **$exists**.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b37a3fe74e0db37183"}, {"id": "mongo-13-prob-9", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9c07a3fe74e0db37684", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9c07a3fe74e0db37684", "name": "Problem #89: Find inventory with name containing Item", "title": "Problem #89: Find inventory with name containing Item", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "89", "difficulty": "Medium", "description": "Return inventory wher