ocuments where the field is either a 32-bit integer or a floating-point double.\n\n### 🛠️ Practical $exists & $type Queries\n```javascript\n// 1. Find students where the "class" field is completely missing\ndb.students.find({\n  class: { $exists: false }\n})\n\n// 2. Find students where the "class" field exists\ndb.students.find({\n  class: { $exists: true }\n})\n\n// 3. Data Auditing: Find records where "age" was mistakenly stored as a String ("24")\ndb.students.find({\n  age: { $type: "string" }\n})\n\n// 4. Find records where "age" is strictly a 32-bit Integer ("int")\ndb.students.find({\n  age: { $type: "int" }\n})\n\n// 5. Find records where "age" is EITHER a Double OR a 32-bit Integer\ndb.students.find({\n  age: { $type: ["double", "int" }\n})\n\n// 6. Querying by numeric BSON type code (1 = "double")\ndb.students.find({\n  age: { $type: 1 }\n})\n```	Yahoo Baba	https://www.youtube.com/@YahooBaba	655	Lecture 13: Element Query Operators — $exists & $type (BSON Type Filtering)	Filter documents by field presence or absence using $exists and audit or query fields by their underlying BSON storage type using $type.	20	Easy	\N	13	[{"id": "mongo-13-prob-1", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db37675", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db37675", "name": "Problem #94: Find inventory with location type Point", "title": "Problem #94: Find inventory with location type Point", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "94", "difficulty": "Medium", "description": "Return inventory where **location.type** is \\"Point\\". Use dot notation.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db37675"}, {"id": "mongo-13-prob-2", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db3765a", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bf7a3fe74e0db3765a", "name": "Problem #103: Find reviews with