ucket & $bucketAuto Examples\n```javascript\n// 1. $bucket: Group students into custom percentage divisions with a "Fail Students" fallback\ndb.students.aggregate([\n  {\n    $bucket: {\n      groupBy: "$percentage",\n      boundaries: [33, 45, 60, 80, 100,\n      default: "Fail Students",\n      output: {\n        count: { $sum: 1 }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n)\n\n// 2. $bucketAuto: Automatically partition students into 3 balanced percentage tiers\ndb.students.aggregate([\n  {\n    $bucketAuto: {\n      groupBy: "$percentage",\n      buckets: 3,\n      output: {\n        count: { $sum: 1 },\n        average_percentage: { $avg: "$percentage" },\n        total_percentage: { $sum: "$percentage" }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n)\n```	Yahoo Baba	https://www.youtube.com/@YahooBaba	655	Lecture 19: Range Bucketing in Aggregations — $bucket & $bucketAuto Stages	Categorize numeric documents into custom histogram ranges using $bucket (with boundaries and default fallback) or automatically balanced range buckets using $bucketAuto.	20	Easy	\N	19	[{"id": "mongo-19-prob-1", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bb7a3fe74e0db374ba", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bb7a3fe74e0db374ba", "name": "Problem #241: Products with price over 225", "title": "Problem #241: Products with price over 225", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "241", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Return products where price > 225.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9bb7a3fe74e0db374ba"}, {"id": "mongo-19-prob-2", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db37363", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db37363", "name": "Problem #352: Products with price lte 30", "title": "Problem #352: Products with price lte 30", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "352", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Return products where **price** is <= 30.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db37363"}, {"id": "mongo-19-prob-3", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db37360", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db37360", "name": "Problem #353: Products with price gte 100", "title": "Problem #353: Products with price gte 100", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "353", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Return products where **price** is >= 100.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db37360"}, {"id": "mongo-19-prob-4", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db3732d", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db3732d", "name": "Problem #370: Top 5 most expensive products", "title": "Problem #370: Top 5 most expensive products", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "370", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Return the 5 products with highest **price**.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db3732d"}, {"id": "mongo-19-prob-5", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db3732a", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db3732a", "name": "Problem #371: Find orders with total between 100 and 300", "title": "Problem #371: Find orders with total between 100 and 300", "platform": "MongoPractice", "problemId": "371", "difficulty": "Medium", "description": "Return orders where **total** is between 100 and 300.", "external_url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db3732a"}, {"id": "mongo-19-prob-6", "url": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-questions/69aab9b77a3fe74e0db3731e", "link": "https://mongopractice.online/mongodb-practice-ques