plicate", "platform": "LeetCode", "problemId": "217", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Given an integer array nums, return true if any value appears at least twice in the array using a HashSet."}]	\N	\N	take U forward (Striver)	https://www.youtube.com/@takeUforward	1	\N	\N	20	Easy	\N	1	[]	\N	\N	\N	\N
